{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27118","headline":"寄宁海李明府 · 周贺","name":"寄宁海李明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山县风光异，公门水石清。\n一官居外府，几载别东京。\n故疾梅天发，新诗雪夜成。\n家贫思减选，时静忆归耕。\n把疏寻书义，澄心得狱情。\n梦灵邀客解，劒古拣人呈。\n守月通宵坐，寻花迥路行。\n从来爱知道，何虑白髭生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}